WEBVTT

00:07:28.756 --> 00:07:31.156
in the central part of Singapore.

00:07:31.196 --> 00:07:34.556
But in the region,
I have regional centers.

00:07:34.556 --> 00:07:38.356
It's one rank below the CBD.

00:07:38.396 --> 00:07:41.436
And below the region, I have town centers,

00:07:41.476 --> 00:07:42.636
in new towns.

00:07:42.636 --> 00:07:45.396
It's one rank below the regional center.

00:07:45.436 --> 00:07:49.236
and below the town centers
are neighborhood centers.

00:07:49.236 --> 00:07:51.996
So if I live in a neighborhood,

00:07:52.036 --> 00:07:53.916
I want to buy a piece of soap,

00:07:53.956 --> 00:07:55.756
I don't have to go to CBD,

00:07:55.796 --> 00:07:57.796
I just walk to the neighborhood center.

00:07:57.836 --> 00:07:59.116
I can get it.

00:07:59.156 --> 00:08:03.196
But if I want to have,